[{"title":"从白水砌过访浴日主人不遇诗以怀之 其三","author":"张萱","text":"巨浸连天一叶舟，儿孙扶侍镜中游。\n归帆似载山阴雪，不是当年王子猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写墨竹寿内弟车柏台五十有一并赠以诗 其一","author":"张萱","text":"潇湘秋色两三枝，写向华堂照寿卮。\n却羡主人才半百，雄名何必减车骑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写墨竹寿内弟车柏台五十有一并赠以诗 其二","author":"张萱","text":"邯郸道上忆交亲，四十年来复几人。\n我已白头君绿鬓，相逢莫惜醉千巡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望小桃源怀韩寅仲诗以劝驾 其一","author":"张萱","text":"桃源惊说是比邻，欲借慈航试问津。\n隔浦渔郎却摇手，主人不是避秦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望小桃源怀韩寅仲诗以劝驾 其二","author":"张萱","text":"双林东望有幽栖，苦竹丛中谢豹啼。\n可是主人曾问世，不言桃李已成蹊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸿华庵望水有感 其一","author":"张萱","text":"福田争说在修桥，附郭良畴水尽漂。\n岁岁老农曾顶礼，慈悲何以救青苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸿华庵望水有感 其二","author":"张萱","text":"鳖裙鸭脚付东流，野老桥边哭未休。\n从此伊蒲无一物，直将忍水灌比丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡虞卿以素卷来索拙书有苏书换羊之戏遂书近作还之亦得戏语二十八字恐羊肉不可换止堪换天妃庙畔茅柴一壶耳","author":"张萱","text":"窗明几净墨花开，曾战山阴笔阵来。\n多谢瘦羊贤博士，却将羊肉数斤回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭朱季美 其一","author":"张萱","text":"生前自负鲁朱家，客刺尝闻载一车。\n昔日虹冈金石友，相逢能否问西华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭朱季美 其二","author":"张萱","text":"临池我爱黎瑶石，焚研曾怜邓玉庵。\n君去好寻林太史，鹅经鹘帖更须参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭朱季美 其三","author":"张萱","text":"彻骨风流刺骨贫，浪游生计倦游身。\n与君同岁不同老，俱是人间失路人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭朱季美 其四","author":"张萱","text":"交情莫向五羊论，聚散惟知冷与暄。\n紫雾旧庐双白板，想应题作翟公门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为欧嘉可题溪山积雪图 其一","author":"张萱","text":"玄冥使者太痴顽，戏触天孙碎佩环。\n散入墨池作滕六，霏霏幻出玉溪山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为欧嘉可题溪山积雪图 其二","author":"张萱","text":"万斛琼瑶扑地飞，剡溪孤棹未应归。\n不知招隐缘何事，我爱袁安独掩扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过小桃源用前韵戏赠主人 其一","author":"张萱","text":"桃花深处迥无邻，曾许渔郎再问津。\n溪雨亦知园主意，却从花底拒游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过小桃源用前韵戏赠主人 其二","author":"张萱","text":"阴阴夏木傍禅栖，何处提壶向客啼。\n门榜传言休见面，茂华不用扫花蹊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己未人日有感 其一","author":"张萱","text":"宿雨初收日正晞，迎暄花气满春衣。\n饶它巧作薰天饼，不及园公菜甲肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己未人日有感 其二","author":"张萱","text":"蓂砌晴开七叶春，宜人春色一番新。\n若教剪綵为人胜，莫像新人像旧人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石图","author":"张萱","text":"饱餐霜雪古冥灵，短筱萧疏凤刷翎。\n共抱皴云一拳玉，閒来长对草玄亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翻马图","author":"张萱","text":"洼水惊看龙种跃，却惜人间无伯乐。\n长嘶骧首啼掀天，奚官且莫轻笼络。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月影三章 其一","author":"张萱","text":"歌慵舞懒更妆残，抱得琵琶莫浪弹。\n却笑才人嫁厮卒，不如图里影常单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月影三章 其二","author":"张萱","text":"幽期空热博山炉，谁道人间有丈夫。\n自惜个中些子事，问郎能入画图无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月影三章 其三","author":"张萱","text":"图成疑是卓文君，一段琴心几处闻。\n但使妾身长似月，不妨圆缺两平分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写枯木竹石图用来韵答谢朱元价宗伯并识以诗 其一","author":"张萱","text":"鹿豕木石皆可与，径绝云深不知处。\n数拳老碧数枝秋，一枕千山谢尘侣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写枯木竹石图用来韵答谢朱元价宗伯并识以诗 其二","author":"张萱","text":"美人遥在五云端，梁月长悬梦里观。\n遥持一幅萧疏意，共向天涯结岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写山水送李伯开","author":"张萱","text":"岧峣绝巘倚天开，万斛秋光照碧苔。\n有客茅亭閒抱膝，隔溪童子借琴回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余士翘博士之任北流以诗见贻用来韵却答 其一","author":"张萱","text":"遥忆趋庭八桂年，君行今赠敬亭毡。\n骨高莫笑广文马，瓶罄谁贻司业钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余士翘博士之任北流以诗见贻用来韵却答 其二","author":"张萱","text":"出门春色正无涯，郁水湘山春更赊。\n问字争传门有雪，佐饔应喜粥无砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其一","author":"张萱","text":"金银宫阙满人间，移得蓬莱第一山。\n为忆汉宫祠太乙，不知徐福几时还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其二","author":"张萱","text":"天飞不用驾风雷，吐燄迸光舞几回。\n可是照天无蜡烛，六龙今放烛龙来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其三","author":"张萱","text":"谁楦一角舞狂且，不向人间吐玉书。\n满腹光芒缘底事，空留馀烬委枯渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其四","author":"张萱","text":"睊睊作慝满郊圻，帝远官多总不知。\n虎兕于今皆出柙，祇应夜夜舞狻猊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其五","author":"张萱","text":"麒麟舞罢舞神羊，钲鼓无端闹几场。\n今日神羊非昔日，奸邪不触触忠良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其六","author":"张萱","text":"一岁常勾五岁逋，十钱完得一钱无。\n欲呼共醉观灯去，苦乏馀钱过酒垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其七","author":"张萱","text":"闭户移灯拂冻蝇，寒云叆叇月鬅鬙。\n更怜卖犊蚩蚩者，止买戈鋋不买灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其八","author":"张萱","text":"万井萧条簇冷烟，欲将灯火卜今年。\n龙淙蛾缲鱼文缕，满市高悬不值钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其九","author":"张萱","text":"烘堂绕坐满儿孙，膝下灯前酒一尊。\n共愿金吾严禁夜，石壕不复夜敲门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其十","author":"张萱","text":"莫开华宴莫徵歌，茧卜空传吉语多。\n九气相怜如赐福，且饶今夕免催科。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其十一","author":"张萱","text":"观灯慎莫近官家，翼虎咆哮尽押衙。\n见说火符连夜发，蛄蝼无地穴黄沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥榕溪灯夕谣 其十二","author":"张萱","text":"杖藜不复渡星桥，一室如冰倍泬寥。\n有酒有诗思老友，无灯无月渡元宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日同人韩叔捷参知以诗见贻用来韵却答","author":"张萱","text":"儿童且莫卖呆痴，我爱呆痴汝不知。\n但愿明朝新胜旧，休论昨日是耶非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日","author":"张萱","text":"甲子重逢又七年，春光共买不须钱。\n我閒君健时相见，酒价何妨斗十千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五夜奉迎邑侯雨中观灯雅集岁癸亥余尝为榕溪灯夕词十二章今采民谣复为甲子灯夕词十六章抚今追昔喜可知也 其一","author":"张萱","text":"去年此夕事堪悲，此夕今年乐不支。\n灯市纵横穿酒市，铜鞮歌满习家池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689"