},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其一","author":"张萱","text":"我亦曾乘太乙莲，归来错问五湖船。\n因君却欲凌波去，同伴灵龟叶上眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其二","author":"张萱","text":"尘缘敕断勿相牵，何必功成学计然。\n怪底莫愁不同载，红妆已伴白头仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其三","author":"张萱","text":"玄真原是我前身，不问乘桴击楫人。\n安得常移五石瓠，与君共结濯缨邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其四","author":"张萱","text":"诏板何烦下鹄头，采芳已向水晶游。\n一叶不防人负去，笑他争说壑藏舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其五","author":"张萱","text":"兰桡不宿蓼花洲，莫拟山阴棹雪舟。\n歌罢采莲龟作枕，梦中亦是镜中游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其六","author":"张萱","text":"谁倾北斗泻银河，不羡河中挂壁梭。\n贯月有槎今老懒，成都卜肆复谁过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用平年兄有小舟曰荷花片以诗索赠次来韵赋答 其七","author":"张萱","text":"黑甜久已傲羲皇，副墨名山万古藏。\n日日枕流非洗耳，疏慵应住水云乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌姬玉兰口号见赠亦用其韵即席答之 其一","author":"张萱","text":"燕子楼前未闭关，白头常伴白云閒。\n若向五湖同一泛，西园亦是鹿门山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌姬玉兰口号见赠亦用其韵即席答之 其二","author":"张萱","text":"老来春色却相关，花事勿忙苦未閒。\n见说藁砧真解事，可曾山上又安山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵赠李文娥歌姬 其一","author":"张萱","text":"无端老子出花关，转入花丛便不閒。\n卧对玉兰春梦起，阳台又在一重山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵赠李文娥歌姬 其二","author":"张萱","text":"新花何意傍柴关，花底游蜂莫放閒。\n欲问青莲采石后，江边可有望夫山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又为刘玉真黄文燕黄玉英三歌姬即席赋 其一","author":"张萱","text":"双桨何来载莫愁，尊前一曲月如钩。\n但教黄阁回青眼，莫遣红裙笑白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18987,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35